Im not the most expert nethacker, but Id suggest engrave the E word on
the upstair & attacking.  I dont suppose you have a wand of fire or
lightning? Go upstairs to rest and keep repeating until they are all
finished. If you want to keep the pet, you will have to be a bit
careful though.  In the future, stealth is always useful for throne
rooms as you can then sneak in and take the monsters out one by one.

To your second questions, as long as you have safe_pet set, you pet
will stop attacking the mimic once it is low on hp.  So if there are
no other dangers in the room, it should survive while you finish the
mimic off.

Hope this helps, some other better players might have different ideas
though...


